35. Acceptance Criteria
The first complete release shall be considered functionally acceptable when:
•	the reactor can move from offline to annihilation stage;
•	the reactor can move from annihilation stage to dark-fusion stage;
•	automatic startup can complete successfully;
•	manual startup can complete successfully;
•	normal operation requires meaningful operator adjustment;
•	the reactor can be shut down through a valid procedure;
•	at least one recoverable emergency is implemented;
